Teach me what I never knew
Increase my knowledge
Clear teachings from You

[Chorus]

My Lord, make me a submitter to You,
Teach me my religion, keep me steadfast too.
Teach me the true meaning of Your Words,
Help me live by them in all I do.

[Bridge]

Teach me the scripture
Teach me what I never knew

[Breakdown]

Teach… me…
Teach… me…

Clear… teachings…
from You…

[Outro]

