Feel the care
Every moment
He is there
Recall your blessings
Night and morn
From the day
That you were born
Health and peace
Provision sent
All from Him
The Magnificent
Recall your blessings
Recall your blessings…
Recall…
Your blessings…
From God…
Alone…
