Every moment
A hidden test
Joy or pain
Both are blessed

[Chorus]
Submit
Be content
With what He sends
Submit
Accept His will
The trial ends

[Verse 1]
Why complain
When tests arrive
Every hardship
Keeps you alive

[Chorus]
Submit
Be content
With what He gives
Submit
Accept His will
And truly live

[Verse 2]
Why resist
The path He draws
In every trial
He sees your flaws

[Chorus]
Submit
Trust the plan
Though eyes can’t see
Submit
In gratitude
The heart is free

[Verse 3]
Why fight back
When pain is sent
To purify
Your inner intent

[Chorus]
Submit
Say “We return
To You alone”
Submit
In patience shown
The soul is known

[Outro]
Submit… submit…
Submit… submit…
Submit… submit…
